#: dialogs/EditFilterDialog.cpp:64
msgid "&Clear"
msgstr "&Limpar"

#: dialogs/EditFilterDialog.cpp:65
msgid ""
"<p>By clicking here you will clear the filter. If you intend to undo the "
"last appending just click on the \"Undo\" button.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Se preme aquí limpará o filtro. Se quixese anular só a última adición "
"simplesmente prema o botón \"Desfacer\".</p>"

#: dialogs/EditFilterDialog.cpp:67
